In article <1pv2sfINNo70@tamsun.tamu.edu> rmv2498@tamuts.tamu.edu (Ryan Mark Vurlicer) writes:

Spoilers....

>
>	1. blessed tinning kit [I really like having one of these; nothing hurts more than munching a dragon then finding a tengu and killing him and having to 
>watch the corpse rot; also makes meals such as dragons much less filling which
>is actually good at times]

I can think of things that hurt considerably more than that.  I have
found that some normally poisonous or rotting corpses are edible after
tinning them.

>	2. blessed crystal ball (3) [can you wish for more charges than that?
>		really useful on the Elemental levels.  Only time I've ascended
>		so far, I got lucky on the plane of Earth and found out what I
>		was supposed to be looking for.  

I had to figure out what to do there, too.  Good thing I had a
pickaxe!  The Amulet will help you find the portal if you wear it.
Also, a scroll of gold detection (cursed or read while confused) will
do the trick.

>	3.  3 potions of unholy water.  There's some good stuff to curse out 
>		there.

Bell of opening or scrolls of genocide to summon appropriate monsters.
Scrolls of teleport for level teleport (easy to get confused and do
same thing).  What else would you want cursed?

>	4.  boots of water walking.  Potential to pay themselves back 
>		thousandfold by an unlimited supply of blank paper and water.

A ring of levitation will accomplish the same thing.

>	5.  icebox.  Just to see one.  [I've come across two in all the games
>		I've ever played...]

The only use I can think of for this is on an altar level.  You can
keep corpses fresh until you get them to the altar.

>	6.  Magic flute.  Neat toy.

Agreed, but a harp is better.

>	8.  wand of cancellation  [Ever used one on a nymph?]

What does she do?

>	Though just occurred to me.  Can you wish for a living critter?  Like,
>a gray dragon?  Not a particularly useful ability, but just curious.  Time to
>go into discovery mode.  

Yes.  Wish for a cursed figurine of a gray dragon.  A blessed one
will give you a pet when applied, but a cursed one will attack.  A
cursed scroll of genocide sends in a bunch of the desired creatures.

